  "description": "A fully-managed C# compression library (no P/Invoke, no native dependencies). Provides compression, decompression, format enumeration and magic-byte detection for gzip, zopfli, zlib, deflate, brotli, xz, lzma, bzip2, lz4 (standard/legacy/lg), lzop and zstd — including a pure-managed XZ (LZMA2) encoder and a real Zopfli deflate encoder.",
